  CONVICTION WALK-FORWARD — rolling 2-year windows vs SPY over the same dates

  screen                 beat SPY   mean excess    median     worst  turnover
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  deep_value                 6/15        -1.5%     -1.3%    -18.3%       9%
  quality_value              4/15        -4.2%     -1.3%    -21.4%      10%
  piotroski_value            4/15        -4.6%     -4.4%    -25.3%      16%
